.MARINE...
(Today through Saturday)
Issued at 1054 AM PDT Mon Sep 7 2026

Moderate to fresh northwest breezes gradually diminish across the
coastal waters today becoming more moderate. Northwest winds
gradually diminish to gentle to moderate tonight which then
prevails through the remainder of the week. Winds look to increase
late this week into the weekend. A long period southerly swell
induced by distant tropical cyclone activity in the East Pacific
prevails into next week.

